    <statement><p>Find the product
<me>2 \sqrt{2} \left( 5 \sqrt{12} + 7 \sqrt{6}  \right)</me>
and express your answer in the form <m>A \sqrt{B} + C \sqrt{D},</m> <m>A</m>, <m>B</m>, <m>C</m>, and <m>D</m> are all integers and <m>B &gt; D.</m></p>
<p>Answer: <m>A =</m> <fillin characters="15" name="AnSwEr0001"/>, <m>B =</m> <fillin characters="15" name="AnSwEr0002"/>, <m>C =</m> <fillin characters="15" name="AnSwEr0003"/>, and <m>D =</m> <fillin characters="15" name="AnSwEr0004"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>2\cdot 2\cdot 5</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>6</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>2\cdot 2\cdot 7</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>3</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
